{
  "contract": [
    "Ancestral Evolution 806229 (Barbarian raid talent) reads 'all party and raid members reflect 20% of all damage taken for 20 sec'.",
    "The raid-wide carrier (SPELL_EFFECT_APPLY_AREA_AURA_RAID, radius 100, duration 20 s) ships effect 0 as a DUMMY aura with ProcFlags 0, so nothing ever fired. The load-time contract repoints effect 0 at PROC_TRIGGER_SPELL_WITH_VALUE (amount 20, the authored 20%) and arms PROC_FLAG_TAKEN_DAMAGE | PROC_FLAG_TAKEN_PERIODIC; aura_ascension_ancestral_evolution deals the 20% share back at the attacker as physical damage.",
    "Expected: after the Barbarian casts 806229 onto its party member, a hostile Warrior's melee swings hurt the attacker for 20% of each taken hit (attacker health falls by 0.19-0.21x the member's health loss), while a second member without the aura takes the same swings with no reflection onto the attacker."
